       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TABLESEARCHALL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-EMP-TABLE.
           05 WS-EMP-ROW OCCURS 100 TIMES ASCENDING KEY IS WS-EMP-ID
               INDEXED BY WS-EMP-IDX.
               10 WS-EMP-ID PIC 9(5).
               10 WS-EMP-NAME PIC X(20).
       01 WS-TARGET PIC 9(5) VALUE 50001.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-EMP-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-EMP-IDX > 100
               COMPUTE WS-EMP-ID(WS-EMP-IDX) = 50000 + WS-EMP-IDX
               MOVE 'EMPLOYEE' TO WS-EMP-NAME(WS-EMP-IDX)
           END-PERFORM.

           SEARCH ALL WS-EMP-TABLE
               AT END DISPLAY 'NOT FOUND'
               WHEN WS-EMP-ID(WS-EMP-IDX) = WS-TARGET
                   DISPLAY WS-EMP-NAME(WS-EMP-IDX)
           END-SEARCH.
           STOP RUN.
